    "\u015eu an rahats\u0131z etmeyin a\u00e7\u0131k.": "Ikke forstyrr er p\u00e5 akkurat n\u00e5.", // EN: Do Not Disturb is on right now.
    "\u015eu an sessiz saatler i\u00e7inde.": "Stille timer er aktive akkurat n\u00e5.", // EN: Quiet hours are active right now.
    "\u00dcstteki anahtar kapal\u0131": "Bryteren over er av", // EN: The switch above is off
    "hi\u00e7bir bildirim g\u00f6nderilmez.": "ingen melding sendes.", // EN: no notification is sent.
