    "\u0130letildi": "Levert", // EN: Delivered
    "Baz\u0131 kanallar hata verdi": "Noen kanaler mislyktes", // EN: Some channels failed
    "A\u00e7\u0131k kanal yok": "Ingen kanal er aktivert", // EN: No channel enabled
    "Sessiz saatlerde d\u0131\u015fa d\u00f6n\u00fck kanallar durur; uyar\u0131lar uygulama i\u00e7inde birikmeye devam eder.": "I stille timer pauser utg\u00e5ende kanaler;varsler fortsetter \u00e5 samle seg inne i appen.", // EN: During quiet hours outbound channels pause; alerts keep accumulating inside the app.
    "Kritik uyar\u0131lar sessiz saatleri a\u015fs\u0131n": "La kritiske varsler omg\u00e5 stille timer", // EN: Let critical alerts bypass quiet hours
    "G\u00fcvenlik, acil durum ve alarm olaylar\u0131 bu saatlerde de bildirilir.": "Sikkerhets-, n\u00f8d- og alarmhendelser leveres fortsatt i disse timene.", // EN: Security, emergency and alarm events are still delivered during those hours.
    "Ses ve Titre\u015fim": "Lyd og vibrasjon", // EN: Sound and Vibration
    "Kritik uyar\u0131lar her zaman sesli gelir. Titre\u015fim yaln\u0131zca telefonda ge\u00e7erlidir; Android'de ses ve titre\u015fim ayr\u0131ca telefonun bildirim ayarlar\u0131ndan da de\u011fi\u015ftirilebilir.": "Kritiske varsler lyder alltid.Vibrasjon gjelder kun p\u00e5 telefoner;p\u00e5 Android kan lyd og vibrasjon ogs\u00e5 endres i systemvarslingsinnstillingene.", // EN: Critical alerts always sound. Vibration applies on phones only; on Android, sound and vibration can also be changed in the system notification settings.
    "Bilgisayar a\u00e7\u0131l\u0131nca ba\u015flat": "Start med datamaskin", // EN: Start with computer
    "Bilgisayar a\u00e7\u0131ld\u0131\u011f\u0131nda NEXUS arka planda a\u00e7\u0131ls\u0131n.": "Start NEXUS i bakgrunnen n\u00e5r datamaskinen starter.", // EN: Launch NEXUS in the background when your computer starts.
    "Kapat\u0131nca arka planda \u00e7al\u0131\u015ft\u0131r": "Fortsett \u00e5 kj\u00f8re i bakgrunnen n\u00e5r den er lukket", // EN: Keep running in background when closed
    "Pencere kapat\u0131lsa da otomasyonlar tepside \u00e7al\u0131\u015fmaya devam etsin.": "Automatisering fortsetter \u00e5 kj\u00f8re i systemstatusfeltet n\u00e5r vinduet er lukket.", // EN: Automations keep running in system tray when the window is closed.
