    "Sens\u00f6rler": "Sensorer", // EN: Sensors
    "Hareket, kap\u0131/pencere ve \u00e7evre sens\u00f6rleri": "Bevegelses-, d\u00f8r-/vindu- og milj\u00f8sensorer", // EN: Motion, door/window and environmental sensors
    "\u0130klimlendirme ve Enerji": "Klima og energi", // EN: Climate and Energy
    "Ak\u0131ll\u0131 priz, r\u00f6le ve anahtar \u00fcr\u00fcnleri": "Smarte plugg-, rel\u00e9- og bryterprodukter", // EN: Smart plug, relay and switch products
