    "JSON olarak d\u0131\u015fa aktar": "Eksporter som JSON", // EN: Export as JSON
    "Kay\u0131tl\u0131 ge\u00e7mi\u015f yok; yaln\u0131zca son okumalar d\u0131\u015fa aktar\u0131l\u0131r.": "Ingen lagret historikk enn\u00e5;bare de siste m\u00e5lingene eksporteres.", // EN: No stored history yet; only the latest readings are exported.
    "G\u00fc\u00e7 \u00f6l\u00e7en cihaz ekleyince ger\u00e7ek de\u011fer burada g\u00f6r\u00fcn\u00fcr.": "Legg til en str\u00f8mm\u00e5ler for \u00e5 se virkelige verdier her.", // EN: Add a power-metering device to see real values here.
    "{0} g\u00fc\u00e7 \u00f6l\u00e7\u00fcml\u00fc cihazdan ger\u00e7ek okuma.": "Direkteavlesning fra {0} m\u00e5lte enhet(er).", // EN: Live reading from {0} metered device(s).
    "Cihazlardan \u00f6l\u00e7\u00fcm al\u0131namad\u0131 (\u00e7evrimd\u0131\u015f\u0131 olabilir).": "Kunne ikke lese m\u00e5linger (enheter kan v\u00e6re frakoblet).", // EN: Could not read measurements (devices may be offline).
    "\u00b7 Etkin (her gece 23:00)": "\u00b7 Aktiv (hver kveld kl. 23.00)", // EN: · Active (nightly at 23:00)
    "\u00b7 Etkin (konum tetiklemesi yak\u0131nda)": "\u00b7 Aktiv (posisjonsutl\u00f8ser kommer snart)", // EN: · Active (location trigger coming soon)
    "Bu strateji zamanlamayla \u00e7al\u0131\u015f\u0131r: uygulama a\u00e7\u0131kken (masa\u00fcst\u00fcnde tepsideyken) her gece 23:00'te se\u00e7ili enerji cihazlar\u0131n\u0131n g\u00fcc\u00fcn\u00fc keser.": "Denne strategien kj\u00f8rer etter en tidsplan: mens appen er \u00e5pen (i skuffen p\u00e5 skrivebordet), kutter den str\u00f8mmen til de valgte energienhetene hver natt klokken 23:00.", // EN: This strategy runs on a schedule: while the app is open (in the tray on desktop), it cuts power to the selected energy devices nightly at 23:00.
    "Bu strateji konum tetiklemesine dayan\u0131r; otomatik konum tetiklemesi hen\u00fcz yok. Etkinle\u015ftirdi\u011finde kaydedilir ama kendili\u011finden \u00e7al\u0131\u015fmaz.": "Denne strategien er avhengig av lokasjonsutl\u00f8sere;automatisk posisjonsutl\u00f8sning er ikke tilgjengelig enn\u00e5.Aktivering lagrer den, men den vil ikke kj\u00f8re av seg selv.", // EN: This strategy relies on location triggers; automatic location triggering isn't available yet. Enabling saves it, but it won't run on its own.
    "Bu tetikleyici t\u00fcr\u00fc hen\u00fcz otomatik \u00e7al\u0131\u015fm\u0131yor; kaydetti\u011finde a\u015fa\u011f\u0131da se\u00e7ti\u011fin saatte (zamanlamayla) \u00e7al\u0131\u015f\u0131r.": "Denne utl\u00f8sertypen kj\u00f8rer ikke automatisk enn\u00e5;n\u00e5r den er lagret, kj\u00f8rer den p\u00e5 tidspunktet du velger nedenfor (planlagt).", // EN: This trigger type doesn't run automatically yet; once saved, it runs at the time you pick below (scheduled).
    "G\u00fcvenlik modu tetikleyicisi kurulamaz: uygulamada okunabilen ger\u00e7ek bir alarm paneli durumu veya NEXUS d\u00fczeyinde bir mod anahtar\u0131 hen\u00fcz yok. \u00c7al\u0131\u015fan t\u00fcrler: Zamanlay\u0131c\u0131, Hava Durumu, Cihaz Durumu ve Alarm Tetiklendi\u011finde (sens\u00f6r).": "En sikkerhetsmodusutl\u00f8ser kan ikke settes opp: appen har ingen lesbar alarmpanelstatus eller NEXUS-niv\u00e5modusbryter enn\u00e5.Arbeidstyper: Timer, V\u00e6r, Enhetstilstand og Alarm utl\u00f8st (sensor).", // EN: A security-mode trigger can't be set up: the app has no readable alarm-panel state or NEXUS-level mode switch yet. Working types: Timer, Weather, Device State and Alarm Triggered (sensor).
    "Bu tetikleyici t\u00fcr\u00fc hen\u00fcz desteklenmiyor, bu y\u00fczden kaydedilemez. \u00c7al\u0131\u015fan t\u00fcrler: Zamanlay\u0131c\u0131, Hava Durumu, Cihaz Durumu ve Alarm Tetiklendi\u011finde (sens\u00f6r).": "Denne utl\u00f8sertypen st\u00f8ttes ikke enn\u00e5, s\u00e5 den kan ikke lagres.Arbeidstyper: Timer, V\u00e6r, Enhetstilstand og Alarm utl\u00f8st (sensor).", // EN: This trigger type isn't supported yet, so it can't be saved. Working types: Timer, Weather, Device State and Alarm Triggered (sensor).
    "Hava Ko\u015fulu": "V\u00e6rforhold", // EN: Weather Condition
    "Ev konumunun ger\u00e7ek hava verisi uygulama a\u00e7\u0131kken yakla\u015f\u0131k 10 dk'da bir okunur. Ko\u015ful sa\u011flanm\u0131yorken sa\u011flan\u0131r hale geldi\u011finde senaryo bir kez \u00e7al\u0131\u015f\u0131r.": "Ekte v\u00e6rdata for hjemmeposisjonen din leses omtrent hvert 10. minutt mens appen er \u00e5pen.Scenarioet kj\u00f8rer \u00e9n gang n\u00e5r betingelsen g\u00e5r fra ikke oppfylt til oppfylt.", // EN: Real weather data for your home location is read about every 10 minutes while the app is open. The scenario runs once when the condition goes from not met to met.
    "S\u0131cakl\u0131k (\u00b0C)": "Temperatur (\u00b0C)", // EN: Temperature (°C)
    "R\u00fczg\u00e2r (km/sa)": "Vind (km/t)", // EN: Wind (km/h)
    "Ya\u011f\u0131\u015f (mm)": "Nedb\u00f8r (mm)", // EN: Precipitation (mm)
    "\u00dcst\u00fcne \u00e7\u0131k\u0131nca": "Hever seg over", // EN: Rises above
