    "Sipari\u015fle ilgili sorun mu var? Geri bildirim g\u00f6nder": "Problemer med en bestilling?Send tilbakemelding", // EN: Problem with an order? Send feedback
    "Haz\u0131r olanlar \u00e7al\u0131\u015f\u0131r durumda; haz\u0131r olmayanlar \"Yak\u0131nda\" olarak i\u015faretlidir.": "Klare varer fungerer n\u00e5;varer som ikke er klare merkes med \"Kommer snart\".", // EN: Ready items work now; items that are not ready are marked "Coming soon".
    "Apple Watch Deste\u011fi Yak\u0131nda": "Apple Watch-st\u00f8tte kommer snart", // EN: Apple Watch Support Coming Soon
    "NEXUS hen\u00fcz Apple Watch uygulamas\u0131 i\u00e7ermiyor. Yay\u0131nland\u0131\u011f\u0131nda bile\u011finden senaryolar\u0131 \u00e7al\u0131\u015ft\u0131r\u0131p kritik uyar\u0131lar\u0131 g\u00f6rebileceksin.": "NEXUS inkluderer ikke en Apple Watch-app enn\u00e5.N\u00e5r den er sluppet, vil du kunne kj\u00f8re scenarier og se kritiske varsler fra h\u00e5ndleddet.", // EN: NEXUS does not include an Apple Watch app yet. Once released, you will be able to run scenarios and see critical alerts from your wrist.
    "Bug\u00fcn Ne Yapabilirsin": "Hva du kan gj\u00f8re i dag", // EN: What You Can Do Today
    "Kritik olaylar i\u00e7in bildirimleri a\u00e7\u0131k tut; uyar\u0131lar\u0131 telefonunda hemen g\u00f6r\u00fcrs\u00fcn.": "Hold varsler p\u00e5 for kritiske hendelser;du ser varsler p\u00e5 telefonen med en gang.", // EN: Keep notifications on for critical events; you see alerts on your phone right away.
    "Saatinde bu bildirimlerin g\u00f6r\u00fcn\u00fcp g\u00f6r\u00fcnmeyece\u011fi iPhone'unun Watch ayarlar\u0131na ba\u011fl\u0131d\u0131r; NEXUS saate \u00f6zel bir \u015fey g\u00f6ndermez.": "Hvorvidt disse varslene vises p\u00e5 klokken din, avhenger av iPhone-klokkeinnstillingene;NEXUS sender ikke noe spesifikt til klokken.", // EN: Whether these notifications show on your watch depends on your iPhone's Watch settings; NEXUS sends nothing specific to the watch.
    "Bildirim Ayarlar\u0131n\u0131 A\u00e7": "\u00c5pne varslingsinnstillinger", // EN: Open Notification Settings
    "Anahtar\u0131 kopyala": "Kopier n\u00f8kkel", // EN: Copy key
    "Kimlik uygulamas\u0131nda a\u00e7": "\u00c5pne i autentiseringsappen", // EN: Open in authenticator app
    "Kimlik uygulamas\u0131na eri\u015fimini kaybedersen giri\u015fte kod istenece\u011fi i\u00e7in hesab\u0131na giremezsin. Bu anahtar\u0131 g\u00fcvenli bir yere kaydet.": "Hvis du mister tilgangen til autentiseringsappen din, vil du ikke kunne logge p\u00e5, fordi en kode kreves ved p\u00e5logging.Lagre denne n\u00f8kkelen et trygt sted.", // EN: If you lose access to your authenticator app you won't be able to sign in, because a code is required at login. Save this key somewhere safe.
    "Anahtar kopyaland\u0131 \u2713": "N\u00f8kkel kopiert \u2713", // EN: Key copied ✓
    "Kopyalanamad\u0131; anahtar\u0131 elle yaz.": "Kunne ikke kopiere;skriv inn n\u00f8kkelen for h\u00e5nd.", // EN: Couldn't copy; type the key by hand.
