    "Bilgisayar\u0131nda NEXUS masa\u00fcst\u00fc uygulamas\u0131n\u0131 kullan; ayn\u0131 asistan ve kontroller orada da \u00e7al\u0131\u015f\u0131r.": "Bruk NEXUS-skrivebordsappen p\u00e5 datamaskinen din;den samme assistenten og kontrollene fungerer der ogs\u00e5.", // EN: Use the NEXUS desktop app on your computer; the same assistant and controls work there too.
