    "Evden \u00e7\u0131karken a\u00e7\u0131k cihazlar\u0131, kilitleri ve enerji durumunu tek ak\u0131\u015fta kontrol edin.": "Sjekk enheter som st\u00e5r p\u00e5, l\u00e5ser og energistatus i \u00e9n flyt n\u00e5r du forlater hjemmet.", // EN: Check devices left on, locks and energy status in one flow when leaving home.
    "Evden \u00e7\u0131karken a\u00e7\u0131k cihazlar\u0131, kilitleri ve enerji durumunu tek ekranda g\u00f6ster.": "Vis enheter som st\u00e5r p\u00e5, l\u00e5ser og energistatus p\u00e5 \u00e9n skjerm n\u00e5r du forlater hjemmet.", // EN: Show devices left on, locks and energy status on one screen when leaving home.
    "Evden \u00e7\u0131kmadan \u00f6nce a\u00e7\u0131k kalan \u0131\u015f\u0131k, priz, klima ve g\u00fcvenlik ayarlar\u0131n\u0131 tek panelde g\u00f6r. H\u0131zl\u0131 kapatma ve g\u00fcvenlik aktif etme ad\u0131mlar\u0131n\u0131 tek ak\u0131\u015fa topla.": "Se lys, plugger, AC-er og sikkerhetsinnstillinger som st\u00e5r p\u00e5 f\u00f8r du drar hjemmefra, p\u00e5 ett panel.Samle trinnene for rask avstenging og sikkerhetsaktivering i \u00e9n flyt.", // EN: See lights, plugs, ACs and security settings left on before leaving home, on one panel. Gather quick shut-off and security activation steps into one flow.
