    "K\u00f6pr\u00fc, iOS cihaz\u0131nla ayn\u0131 Wi-Fi'da olmal\u0131. Bilgisayar a\u00e7\u0131k kald\u0131k\u00e7a e\u015fle\u015fme ge\u00e7erli kal\u0131r (tepsi/arka plan \u00e7al\u0131\u015fmas\u0131 destekler).": "Broen m\u00e5 v\u00e6re p\u00e5 samme Wi-Fi som iOS-enheten din.Sammenkoblingen forblir gyldig s\u00e5 lenge datamaskinen forblir v\u00e5ken (skuff/bakgrunnsdrift st\u00f8ttes).", // EN: The bridge has to be on the same Wi-Fi as your iOS device. The pairing stays valid as long as your computer stays awake (tray/background operation supported).
