    "Bu ekran\u0131 iPhone'daki NEXUS uygulamas\u0131nda a\u00e7; senaryolar\u0131n a\u015fa\u011f\u0131da listelenir ve her biri i\u00e7in Siri kestirmesi kurabilirsin.": "\u00c5pne denne skjermen i NEXUS-appen p\u00e5 din iPhone;scenene dine er oppf\u00f8rt nedenfor, og du kan sette opp en Siri-snarvei for hver enkelt.", // EN: Open this screen in the NEXUS app on your iPhone; your scenes are listed below and you can set up a Siri shortcut for each one.
    "1. Senaryo ba\u011flant\u0131s\u0131n\u0131 kopyala": "1. Kopier scenelenken", // EN: 1. Copy the scene link
    "Bu ba\u011flant\u0131 NEXUS'u a\u00e7ar ve senaryoyu hemen \u00e7al\u0131\u015ft\u0131r\u0131r.": "Denne lenken \u00e5pner NEXUS og kj\u00f8rer scenen med en gang.", // EN: This link opens NEXUS and runs the scene right away.
    "2. Kestirmeler'de yeni kestirme olu\u015ftur": "2. Opprett en ny snarvei i Snarveier", // EN: 2. Create a new shortcut in Shortcuts
    "\"Eylem Ekle\" \u203a \"URL'leri A\u00e7\" eylemini se\u00e7 ve kopyalad\u0131\u011f\u0131n ba\u011flant\u0131y\u0131 yap\u0131\u015ft\u0131r.": "Velg \u00abLegg til handling\u00bb \u203a \u00ab\u00c5pne URL-er\u00bb og lim inn koblingen du kopierte.", // EN: Choose "Add Action" › "Open URLs" and paste the link you copied.
