    "Kap\u0131 veya Pencere A\u00e7\u0131ld\u0131\u011f\u0131nda": "N\u00e5r en d\u00f8r eller et vindu \u00e5pnes", // EN: When a Door or Window Opens
    "Kap\u0131/pencere sens\u00f6r\u00fc a\u00e7\u0131ld\u0131\u011f\u0131nda": "N\u00e5r en d\u00f8r-/vindussensor \u00e5pnes", // EN: When a door/window sensor opens
    "Duman, su bask\u0131n\u0131 ya da gaz sens\u00f6r\u00fc uyard\u0131\u011f\u0131nda": "N\u00e5r en r\u00f8yk-, flom- eller gasssensor sl\u00e5r alarm", // EN: When a smoke, flood or gas sensor raises an alarm
    "Cihaz ve sens\u00f6r tetikleyicileri, uygun bir cihaz ekleyince burada g\u00f6r\u00fcn\u00fcr.": "Enhets- og sensorutl\u00f8sere vises her n\u00e5r du legger til en passende enhet.", // EN: Device and sensor triggers appear here once you add a suitable device.
    "Ev ve \u00c7evre": "Hjem og omgivelser", // EN: Home & Surroundings
    "S\u0131cakl\u0131k, r\u00fczg\u00e2r ya da ya\u011f\u0131\u015f bir e\u015fi\u011fi ge\u00e7ti\u011finde": "N\u00e5r temperatur, vind eller regn passerer en terskel", // EN: When temperature, wind or rain passes a threshold
