    "Ak\u015fam yeme\u011fi": "Middag", // EN: Dinner
    "Perdeleri a\u00e7": "\u00c5pne gardinene", // EN: Open the curtains
    "Kap\u0131lar\u0131 kilitle": "L\u00e5s d\u00f8rene", // EN: Lock the doors
    "B\u00fct\u00fcn \u0131\u015f\u0131klar\u0131 tam parlakl\u0131kta a\u00e7ar.": "Sl\u00e5r p\u00e5 hvert lys med full lysstyrke.", // EN: Turns on every light at full brightness.
    "B\u00fct\u00fcn \u0131\u015f\u0131klar\u0131 kapat\u0131r.": "Sl\u00e5r av hvert lys.", // EN: Turns off every light.
    "I\u015f\u0131klar\u0131 tam parlakl\u0131kta, g\u00fcn \u0131\u015f\u0131\u011f\u0131 tonunda a\u00e7ar.": "Sl\u00e5r p\u00e5 lys med full lysstyrke i en dagslys tone.", // EN: Turns lights on at full brightness in a daylight tone.
    "I\u015f\u0131klar\u0131 %85 n\u00f6tr tona getirir, TV'yi kapat\u0131r.": "Stiller lyset til 85 % i en n\u00f8ytral tone og sl\u00e5r av TV-en.", // EN: Sets lights to 85% in a neutral tone and turns off the TV.
    "I\u015f\u0131klar\u0131 %40 s\u0131cak tona getirir.": "Stiller lyset til 40 % i en varm tone.", // EN: Sets lights to 40% in a warm tone.
    "Her ak\u015fam 19:30": "Hver kveld 19:30", // EN: Every evening 19:30
    "Klimay\u0131 a\u00e7\u0131p 20\u00b0'ye, termostat\u0131 20\u00b0'ye ayarlar.": "Sl\u00e5r p\u00e5 AC ved 20\u00b0 og setter termostaten til 20\u00b0.", // EN: Turns the AC on at 20° and sets the thermostat to 20°.
    "Termostat\u0131 24\u00b0 konfor ayar\u0131na getirir.": "Stiller termostaten til 24\u00b0 komfortinnstilling.", // EN: Sets the thermostat to a 24° comfort setting.
    "Hafta i\u00e7i 06:30": "Hverdager 06:30", // EN: Weekdays 06:30
    "B\u00fct\u00fcn perde ve panjurlar\u0131 a\u00e7ar.": "\u00c5pner alle gardiner og persienner.", // EN: Opens every curtain and blind.
    "Her g\u00fcn g\u00fcn do\u011fumunda": "Hver dag ved soloppgang", // EN: Every day at sunrise
    "B\u00fct\u00fcn perde ve panjurlar\u0131 kapat\u0131r.": "Lukker alle gardiner og persienner.", // EN: Closes every curtain and blind.
    "Her g\u00fcn g\u00fcn bat\u0131m\u0131nda": "Hver dag ved solnedgang", // EN: Every day at sunset
    "B\u00fct\u00fcn ak\u0131ll\u0131 kilitleri kilitler (kilit hi\u00e7bir zaman a\u00e7\u0131lmaz).": "L\u00e5ser hver smartl\u00e5s (l\u00e5ser l\u00e5ses aldri opp).", // EN: Locks every smart lock (locks are never unlocked).
    "I\u015f\u0131klar\u0131 ve TV'yi kapat\u0131r; prizlere ve klimaya dokunmaz.": "Sl\u00e5r av lys og TV;lar plugger og AC v\u00e6re i fred.", // EN: Turns off lights and the TV; leaves plugs and the AC alone.
    "Bir cihaz\u0131 a\u00e7 ya da kapat": "Sl\u00e5 en enhet p\u00e5 eller av", // EN: Turn a device on or off
    "Se\u00e7ti\u011fin tek cihaza komut g\u00f6nderir.": "Sender en kommando til den ene enheten du velger.", // EN: Sends a command to the one device you pick.
    "Hangi cihaz?": "Hvilken enhet?", // EN: Which device?
    "A\u00e7\u0131ls\u0131n": "Sl\u00e5 p\u00e5", // EN: Turn on
    "Kapans\u0131n": "Sl\u00e5 av", // EN: Turn off
    "Kontrol edilecek cihaz\u0131 se\u00e7.": "Velg enheten du vil kontrollere.", // EN: Choose the device to control.
    "Sens\u00f6rlerinin \u00f6l\u00e7t\u00fc\u011f\u00fc hava kalitesini, s\u0131cakl\u0131\u011f\u0131 ve nemi g\u00f6r; ar\u0131t\u0131c\u0131n\u0131 y\u00f6net.": "Se luftkvaliteten, temperaturen og fuktigheten sensorene dine m\u00e5ler, og kontroller renseren.", // EN: See the air quality, temperature and humidity your sensors measure, and control your purifier.
    "I\u015f\u0131klar\u0131, perdeleri ve klimay\u0131 g\u00fcne ba\u015flarken tek dokunu\u015fla haz\u0131rla.": "Gj\u00f8r lys, gardiner og AC klar for dagen med ett trykk.", // EN: Get lights, curtains and the AC ready for the day with one tap.
    "Eve girerken \u0131\u015f\u0131klar\u0131, perdeleri ve iklimi birlikte a\u00e7.": "Sl\u00e5 p\u00e5 lys, gardiner og klima sammen n\u00e5r du kommer hjem.", // EN: Turn on lights, curtains and climate together when you get home.
    "Uzun s\u00fcre evde yokken cihazlar\u0131n\u0131 g\u00fcvenli ve tasarruflu konuma al.": "Sett enhetene dine i en trygg, energisparende tilstand mens du er borte lenge.", // EN: Put your devices into a safe, energy-saving state while you are away for long.
    "I\u015f\u0131klar\u0131 k\u0131s, perdeleri kapat ve TV'yi a\u00e7.": "Demp lyset, lukk gardinene og sl\u00e5 p\u00e5 TV-en.", // EN: Dim the lights, close the curtains and turn on the TV.
    "Robot s\u00fcp\u00fcrgeni ba\u015flat ya da \u015farj istasyonuna g\u00f6nder.": "Start robotst\u00f8vsugeren eller send den tilbake til kaien.", // EN: Start your robot vacuum or send it back to its dock.
    "Kap\u0131y\u0131 kilitle, perdeleri kapat ve evi geceye haz\u0131rla.": "L\u00e5s d\u00f8ren, lukk gardinene og gj\u00f8r huset klart for natten.", // EN: Lock the door, close the curtains and get the house ready for the night.
    "Ekledi\u011fin kameralar\u0131n durumunu ve gizlilik ayar\u0131n\u0131 tek ekranda g\u00f6r.": "Se status og personverninnstilling for kameraene dine p\u00e5 \u00e9n skjerm.", // EN: See the status and privacy setting of your cameras on one screen.
