    "Priz ve enerji kontrol paneli \u00b7 a\u00e7, kapat, t\u00fcketim": "Plugg og energikontrollpanel \u00b7 p\u00e5, av, forbruk", // EN: Plug and energy control panel · on, off, consumption
    "Ula\u015f\u0131m ve takip paneli \u00b7 konum, \u015farj": "Transport- og sporingspanel \u00b7 plassering, lading", // EN: Transport and tracking panel · location, charge
    "A\u011f ge\u00e7idi paneli \u00b7 ba\u011flant\u0131, durum": "Gateway-panel \u00b7 tilkobling, status", // EN: Gateway panel · connection, status
    "Anahtar kontrol paneli \u00b7 a\u00e7, kapat": "Sl\u00e5 kontrollpanelet \u00b7 p\u00e5, av", // EN: Switch control panel · on, off
    "Bu ad ana sayfa kart\u0131nda ve cihaz listesinde g\u00f6r\u00fcn\u00fcr.": "Dette navnet vises p\u00e5 hjemmekortet og i enhetslisten.", // EN: This name shows on the home card and in the device list.
    "Cihaz ad\u0131n\u0131 de\u011fi\u015ftir": "Gi nytt navn til enheten", // EN: Rename device
    "\u015eifre Belirle": "Angi et passord", // EN: Set a password
    "Bu hesapta hen\u00fcz \u015fifre yok": "Denne kontoen har ikke noe passord enn\u00e5", // EN: This account has no password yet
    "\u015eifren belirlendi \u2713": "Passordet ditt er satt \u2713", // EN: Your password is set ✓
    "Bu hesap Google ile a\u00e7\u0131ld\u0131, i\u00e7inde hen\u00fcz bir \u015fifre yok. \u0130lk \u015fifreni burada belirleyebilirsin; bundan sonra e-posta ve \u015fifreyle de giri\u015f yapabilirsin.": "Denne kontoen ble \u00e5pnet med Google og har ikke noe passord enn\u00e5.Angi ditt f\u00f8rste passord her;etter det kan du ogs\u00e5 logge p\u00e5 med e-post og passord.", // EN: This account was opened with Google and has no password yet. Set your first password here; after that you can also sign in with email and password.
    "\u015eifre belirleme ba\u011flant\u0131s\u0131n\u0131 e-postama g\u00f6nder": "Send meg en lenke til oppsett av passord via e-post", // EN: Email me a password setup link
    "Bu i\u015flem ek do\u011frulama istiyor. A\u015fa\u011f\u0131dan \u015fifre belirleme ba\u011flant\u0131s\u0131 isteyebilirsin.": "Denne handlingen trenger ekstra bekreftelse.Du kan be om en passordoppsettlenke nedenfor.", // EN: This action needs extra verification. You can request a password setup link below.
    "\u015eifre belirleme ba\u011flant\u0131s\u0131 e-postana g\u00f6nderildi \u2713": "Kobling for passordoppsett sendt til innboksen din \u2713", // EN: Password setup link sent to your inbox ✓
    "\u015eifre ba\u011flant\u0131s\u0131 \u015fu anda g\u00f6nderilemiyor.": "Passordkoblingen kan ikke sendes akkurat n\u00e5.", // EN: The password link can't be sent right now.
    "Giri\u015f e-postan bulunamad\u0131; \u00f6nce giri\u015f yap.": "Vi kunne ikke finne e-postadressen for p\u00e5logging.logg inn f\u00f8rst.", // EN: We couldn't find your sign-in email; sign in first.
    "Ba\u011flant\u0131 g\u00f6nderilemedi. Birazdan tekrar dene.": "Linken kunne ikke sendes.Pr\u00f8v igjen om et \u00f8yeblikk.", // EN: The link couldn't be sent. Try again in a moment.
