    "Sonraki \u00f6deme {0} tutar\u0131nda {1} tarihinde al\u0131nacak.": "Neste betaling p\u00e5 {0} vil bli belastet {1}.", // EN: Next payment of {0} will be charged on {1}.
    "A\u015fa\u011f\u0131daki cihazlar internet ba\u011flant\u0131s\u0131 olmadan, ev a\u011f\u0131nda NEXUS'a ba\u011flan\u0131r. Ekledi\u011fin cihazlar {0} modelden se\u00e7ilir.": "Enhetene nedenfor kobles til NEXUS p\u00e5 hjemmenettverket ditt, uten internettforbindelse.Velg blant {0} modeller.", // EN: The devices below connect to NEXUS on your home network, without an internet connection. Choose from {0} models.
    "NEXUS, cihazlar\u0131na do\u011frudan kendi uygulamas\u0131ndan eri\u015fir; HomeKit k\u00f6pr\u00fcs\u00fc i\u00e7ermez. Apple Ev (HomeKit) ile kullanmak istersen en pratik yol {0}: cihazlar\u0131n\u0131 Home Assistant'a ekler, HA'n\u0131n HomeKit entegrasyonunu a\u00e7ars\u0131n.": "NEXUS n\u00e5r enhetene dine direkte fra sin egen app;den har ingen innebygd HomeKit-bro.For \u00e5 bruke dem med Apple Home (HomeKit), er den praktiske veien {0}: legg til enhetene dine i Home Assistant, og aktiver deretter HAs HomeKit-integrasjon.", // EN: NEXUS reaches your devices directly from its own app; it has no built-in HomeKit bridge. To use them with Apple Home (HomeKit), the practical path is {0}: add your devices to Home Assistant, then enable HA's HomeKit integration.
    "NEXUS, cihazlar\u0131na do\u011frudan kendi uygulamas\u0131ndan eri\u015fir; {0} yerle\u015fik bir HomeKit k\u00f6pr\u00fcs\u00fc Apple Ev'e ger\u00e7ek aksesuar yay\u0131nlar (a\u015fa\u011f\u0131daki panelden ba\u015flat). Web/telefon s\u00fcr\u00fcm\u00fcnde k\u00f6pr\u00fc yoktur.": "NEXUS n\u00e5r enhetene dine direkte fra sin egen app;p\u00e5 skrivebordet publiserer {0} innebygd HomeKit bridge ekte tilbeh\u00f8r til Apple Home (start det fra panelet nedenfor).Nett-/telefonversjonen har ingen bro.", // EN: NEXUS reaches your devices directly from its own app; on desktop, {0} built-in HomeKit bridge publishes real accessories to Apple Home (start it from the panel below). The web/phone version has no bridge.
    "NEXUS, cihazlar\u0131na do\u011frudan kendi uygulamas\u0131ndan eri\u015fir; telefon/web s\u00fcr\u00fcm\u00fcnde HomeKit k\u00f6pr\u00fcs\u00fc i\u00e7ermez. Apple Ev (HomeKit) ile kullanmak istersen en pratik yol {0}: cihazlar\u0131n\u0131 Home Assistant'a ekler, HA'n\u0131n HomeKit entegrasyonunu a\u00e7ars\u0131n.": "NEXUS n\u00e5r enhetene dine direkte fra sin egen app;telefon-/nettversjonen inkluderer ikke en HomeKit-bro.For \u00e5 bruke dem med Apple Home (HomeKit), er den praktiske veien {0}: legg til enhetene dine i Home Assistant, og aktiver deretter HAs HomeKit-integrasjon.", // EN: NEXUS reaches your devices directly from its own app; the phone/web version does not include a HomeKit bridge. To use them with Apple Home (HomeKit), the practical path is {0}: add your devices to Home Assistant, then enable HA's HomeKit integration.
    "NEXUS'ta {0} \u00fczerinden Home Assistant'\u0131 ba\u011fla.": "Koble Home Assistant gjennom {0} i NEXUS.", // EN: Connect Home Assistant through {0} in NEXUS.
    "Home Assistant ayarlar\u0131ndan {0} entegrasyonunu ekle; payla\u015fmak istedi\u011fin cihazlar\u0131 se\u00e7.": "I Home Assistant-innstillingene legger du til {0}-integrasjonen og velger enhetene du vil dele.", // EN: In Home Assistant settings, add the {0} integration and pick the devices you want to share.
    "\u00d6deme sayfas\u0131nda {0} kullan; abonelik bu e-postayla e\u015fle\u015fir. Deneme s\u00fcresi bitmeden iptal edersen \u00fccret al\u0131nmaz. Aboneli\u011fini Faturaland\u0131rma sayfas\u0131ndan istedi\u011fin an y\u00f6netebilirsin.": "Bruk {0} p\u00e5 betalingssiden;ditt abonnement samsvarer med denne e-posten.Avbryt f\u00f8r pr\u00f8veperioden er over, og du blir aldri belastet.Administrer abonnementet ditt n\u00e5r som helst fra Faktureringssiden.", // EN: Use {0} on the payment page; your subscription is matched to this email. Cancel before the trial ends and you're never charged. Manage your subscription any time from the Billing page.
    "\u015eifre en az {0} karakter olmal\u0131d\u0131r.": "Passordet m\u00e5 best\u00e5 av minst {0} tegn.", // EN: Password must be at least {0} characters.
